  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut potato into fries.<br>• Place fries on a lined oven tray with baking <br>paper. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt<br>and pepper.<br>• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, <br>20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-01af1000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop garlic. <br>• Cut corn in half. <br>• Thinly slice tomato.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, half the <br>garlic aioli, the white wine vinegar and a pinch <br>of salt and pepper.<br>• In a small bowl, combine the butter and a small <br>pinch of mild Caribbean jerk seasoning (the <br>rest will be used in step 3!).<br>• Bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-09544510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook plant-based burger patties until browned and heated through, 2-3 minutes each side.<br><br>TIP: For even browning, gently press down on the patties using a spatula.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-88262620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the patties are cooking, place corn cobs<br>into the saucepan of boiling water. Cook until <br>tender and bright yellow, 5 minutes. Drain. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-fcd03c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake <br>directly on a wire rack in the oven until heated <br>through, 2-3 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-e8408840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Build your burgers by spreading a layer of the remaining aioli over the base of a bun.<br>• Top with the Jerk plant-based patty burger, tomato and slaw. Serve with the fries and corn cobs.<br>• Spread the Jerk butter over the corn. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3870a822813b6e6e5db7f/step-4c105150.jpg"
    }
  ]
